			"notes": "## Fixes\n\n- Fix players becoming unable to move after `/back` and other same-dimension teleports in complex terrain.\n- Preserve exact saved coordinates without collision-based rejection, raising, or offsetting; only non-finite values are rejected.\n- Validate the destination before dismounting and commit cooldown/back state before notifying teleport callbacks.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- Minecraft 1.12.2\n- Forge 14.23.5.2860\n- Java 8\n\nSHA-256: c401a6d4cecada9c6168d99879db2316aaa127a8b4935ba459a52690dcc6705a"
